## 2. Architecture and Components

### Core Interfaces (in `java.sql`)

| Interface | Purpose | C# Equivalent |
|-----------|---------|---------------|
| `DriverManager` | Manages drivers, creates connections | `DbProviderFactory` |
| `Connection` | A session with the database | `SqlConnection` |
| `Statement` | Executes a static SQL query | `SqlCommand` |
| `PreparedStatement` | Executes parameterized SQL (precompiled) | `SqlCommand` with parameters |
| `CallableStatement` | Calls stored procedures | `SqlCommand` (CommandType.StoredProcedure) |
| `ResultSet` | Iterates over query results (rows) | `SqlDataReader` |

### How They Connect

```
DriverManager.getConnection(url, user, pass)
         │
         ▼
    Connection conn
         │
         ├── conn.createStatement()        → Statement
         ├── conn.prepareStatement(sql)    → PreparedStatement
         └── conn.prepareCall(sql)         → CallableStatement
                    │
                    ▼
              ResultSet rs (for SELECT queries)
```

